{"5221880":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Keepers of the Farkle","steam_appid":5221880,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5222630],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“In a city of infinite doorways to infinite dimensions, many games are played, but only one is a way of life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is why we are Keepers of the Farkle!”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice, push your luck, and challenge unforgettable rivals in a fast-paced game of risk and strategy. Master powerful combinations, unlock colorful characters and custom dice, conquer tournaments, and compete with friends in local multiplayer without an internet connection! Will you bank your points? Or risk everything on one more roll? The Portal is open. The dice are waiting. Become a Keeper!<br><br><strong>Game Modes<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Game:<\/strong> Play Farkle the way the great Dawnkeeper intended! Roll solo against one to four animated computer opponents, banking, keeping, and chasing the exact-8000 win against a computer opponents of varying skill.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:<\/strong> A four-level campaign against Gnart, K9, Amara, and Rico, each with a distinct play style and challenges. Get to know the other players about town by learning their history, and hopefully how to unlock their item! The items add a whole new excited layer to the classic game of 8000.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best 2 out of 3: <\/strong>Play Farkle like we do at the pubs in the Lady’s Ward, one on one and the best two out of three games wins!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament:<\/strong> In the Hub at the Center of the Multiverse, if you aren’t playing for Coins, you might as well be playing a kids game. Every seat antes into a shared pot, with raises and folds shaping who's still in as the bracket plays out. Special dice rolls make your opponents throw even more coins in the pot. Tournament with unlocked items gets real extra-planer!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pass &amp; Play:<\/strong> Local couch multiplayer, no accounts and no items, just the dice, passed hand to hand.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAN Multiplayer:<\/strong> Host or join a match over the same Wi-Fi network for 2 to 4 players. Quick Game and Best 2 out of 3 for fast sessions, or Tournament for ante, pot, and coin stakes across a full bracket! You and your friends can play as your favorite Keeper anywhere on the planet* by creating and playing over a wireless hot-spot from your phone!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Anywhere fit to sustain human lifeforms and electronics.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters &amp; Items<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against Gnart, K9, Amara, and Rico; each with their own strategies, table presence and unique item that gives them special abilities. There is also a secret character to unlock, who is totally not my wife…. Who I will totally not take on a great honeymoon if folks love and buy this game!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Ranks to equip secret items. Unlock dice colors and styles by winning matches in story mode. Unlock secret items by defeating your opponent in ways that impress them.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Exact-8000* Ruleset<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep scoring: <\/strong>Standard Farkle scoring plus straights, three-pairs, and four\/five\/six-of-a-kind multipliers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overshoot busts:<\/strong> You don't just have to reach 8000 — you have to land on it. Roll past it, and the turn busts.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Chance: <\/strong>When the first person reaches 8000 every other player still has one more chance to get to the goal!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8000 Bank-Off: <\/strong>If two or more players land on exactly 8000, the match doesn't end….it goes to a raw Farkle turn to settle the win.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*If you want there is an option to switch the games to highest score over 8000 wins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Keepers of the Farkle, from Keepers of the Light LLC<\/i><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“In a city of infinite doorways to infinite dimensions, many games are played, but only one is a way of life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is why we are Keepers of the Farkle!”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice, push your luck, and challenge unforgettable rivals in a fast-paced game of risk and strategy. Master powerful combinations, unlock colorful characters and custom dice, conquer tournaments, and compete with friends in local multiplayer without an internet connection! Will you bank your points? Or risk everything on one more roll? The Portal is open. The dice are waiting. Become a Keeper!<br><br><strong>Game Modes<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Game:<\/strong> Play Farkle the way the great Dawnkeeper intended! Roll solo against one to four animated computer opponents, banking, keeping, and chasing the exact-8000 win against a computer opponents of varying skill.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:<\/strong> A four-level campaign against Gnart, K9, Amara, and Rico, each with a distinct play style and challenges. Get to know the other players about town by learning their history, and hopefully how to unlock their item! The items add a whole new excited layer to the classic game of 8000.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best 2 out of 3: <\/strong>Play Farkle like we do at the pubs in the Lady’s Ward, one on one and the best two out of three games wins!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament:<\/strong> In the Hub at the Center of the Multiverse, if you aren’t playing for Coins, you might as well be playing a kids game. Every seat antes into a shared pot, with raises and folds shaping who's still in as the bracket plays out. Special dice rolls make your opponents throw even more coins in the pot. Tournament with unlocked items gets real extra-planer!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pass &amp; Play:<\/strong> Local couch multiplayer, no accounts and no items, just the dice, passed hand to hand.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAN Multiplayer:<\/strong> Host or join a match over the same Wi-Fi network for 2 to 4 players. Quick Game and Best 2 out of 3 for fast sessions, or Tournament for ante, pot, and coin stakes across a full bracket! You and your friends can play as your favorite Keeper anywhere on the planet* by creating and playing over a wireless hot-spot from your phone!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Anywhere fit to sustain human lifeforms and electronics.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters &amp; Items<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against Gnart, K9, Amara, and Rico; each with their own strategies, table presence and unique item that gives them special abilities. There is also a secret character to unlock, who is totally not my wife…. Who I will totally not take on a great honeymoon if folks love and buy this game!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Ranks to equip secret items. Unlock dice colors and styles by winning matches in story mode. Unlock secret items by defeating your opponent in ways that impress them.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Exact-8000* Ruleset<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep scoring: <\/strong>Standard Farkle scoring plus straights, three-pairs, and four\/five\/six-of-a-kind multipliers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overshoot busts:<\/strong> You don't just have to reach 8000 — you have to land on it. Roll past it, and the turn busts.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Chance: <\/strong>When the first person reaches 8000 every other player still has one more chance to get to the goal!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8000 Bank-Off: <\/strong>If two or more players land on exactly 8000, the match doesn't end….it goes to a raw Farkle turn to settle the win.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*If you want there is an option to switch the games to highest score over 8000 wins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Keepers of the Farkle, from Keepers of the Light LLC<\/i><\/p>","short_description":"Roll the dice, and challenge the CPU or Freinds in a fast-paced game of risk and strategy. Unlock colorful characters and custom dice, conquer tournaments, and compete with friends in local multiplayer without an internet connection! Will you bank your points? Or risk everything on one more roll?","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5221880\/8947fb2bd5a4ef0113ca8976fbdaf8192b6855fc\/header.jpg?t=1793649672","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5221880\/018ad3d00da8e13b372d2a542657fc3e2bd4025b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793649672","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5221880\/018ad3d00da8e13b372d2a542657fc3e2bd4025b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793649672","website":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/F2n6mcXQiCc?si=wojdaxU2ITpKy6RX","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> dual-core, 2.5 GHz+<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vul